      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A mysterious being that hides within an urn with his head sticking out of it, patiently staring out with it's hand out. The urn has multiple eyes on it.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 27, touch 11, flat-footed 26 (+1 size, +16 natural)</p><p>hp 707 [770] (14d10+630); Fast Healing 70</p><p>Fort +48, Ref +11, Will +16</p><p>DR 30/Epic</p><p>Immune Ability Damage, Ability Drain, All Negative Status Effects, Level Damage, Level Drain, Outsider Traits</p><p>Resist All 70</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed -</p><p>Melee -</p><p>Special Abilities Gimme!</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 10, Dex -, Con 99, Int 12, Wis 20, Cha 14</p><p>Base Atk +14; CMB +13; CMD 23</p><p>Feats Alertness, Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Lightning Reflexes, Skill Focus (Perception), Skill Focus (Sense Motive), Toughness</p><p>Skills Knowledge (Arcana) +18, Knowledge (History) +18, Knowledge (Local) +18, Knowledge (Nature) +18, Knowledge (Planes) +18, Perception +33, Sense Motive +33</p><p>SQ Escape</p>"
